{"type":"message","id":"e04fc4f0","parentId":"afa8b5df","timestamp":"2026-06-01T06:03:35.992Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The endpoints return \"Unauthorized\" for GET requests but the POST returns 1101. Let me try different approaches. Maybe the POST needs to be done differently, or the worker for the send endpoint is broken.\n\nLet me try with a different Content-Type or maybe the body format needs to be different. Actually, looking at the previous successful calls, maybe the issue is that the worker has an exception when processing the send request. Let me try with a minimal payload.\n\nActually, maybe the issue is that the API key has a typo or is wrong. But no, if the key was wrong we'd get \"Unauthorized\" not 1101.\n\n1101 is specifically \"Worker threw an unhandled exception\" in Cloudflare Workers. This means the Worker's send endpoint code has a bug.","thinkingSignature":"86379414b3e3cf442b73962530f50292238e6345205478bb79da858c8db5f4bc"},{"type":"text","text":"POST /send 返回1101（Worker未处理异常），API的send功能当前不可用。让我用简单payload再试一次：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_n54g465nb6oj_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-KEY: ***\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: text/plain\" \\\n  -d 'Heartbeat 06:00 UTC arbitration'"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":15395,"output":275,"cacheRead":13682,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":29352,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780293809268,"responseId":"066c53b17f439a20a70348946caca700"}}
