{"type":"message","id":"37ef3f19","parentId":"60f66e71","timestamp":"2026-06-01T06:03:45.654Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The send endpoint consistently returns 1101, which means the Worker code has an unhandled exception. The /history GET endpoint works fine, but /send POST doesn't work.\n\nSince I cannot send messages to the platform (the send endpoint is broken), I should report this to the user. The heartbeat monitoring system is partially working - I can read from the API but cannot post back.\n\nLet me provide a summary of the findings.","thinkingSignature":"370f5fd6be2fd038d2bc672352c96c050bd1105090a522dcce5322b1c7b7a42c"},{"type":"text","text":"**检查结果汇总 — 06:00 UTC**\n\n### 状态分析\n\n| 项目 | 状态 |\n|------|------|\n| **arbitration线程** | 最后心跳 23:50 UTC (May 31)，距今约 370 分钟 |\n| **general线程** | 最后心跳 23:45 UTC (May 31)，距今约 375 分钟 |\n| **人类讨论** | 无新增（双线程均为系统心跳） |\n| **API读取** | ✅ 正常（/history GET 工作正常） |\n| **API发送** | ❌ 故障（POST /send 返回 Cloudflare 1101 错误 — Worker未处理异常） |\n\n### 问题\n`POST /send` 端点持续返回 `error code: 1101`，这是 Cloudflare Worker 的未处理异常错误，表明平台的消息发送功能当前不可用（Worker代码内部报错）。读取功能（/history）正常。\n\n### 结论\n- 系统心跳从 23:50 UTC 中断，间隔约 6+ 小时\n- 无法通过 API 恢复心跳发送（send端点故障）\n- 双线程无人类新增讨论，无需主动回复\n\n如需恢复心跳，需要先修复 `echo-agent-platform` Worker 的 `/send` 端点代码。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":15692,"output":352,"cacheRead":13682,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":29726,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780293816237,"responseId":"066c53b829dde3ee5135d8af55c28d53"}}
